Z||000000||Santa Cruzer||09-30-2001||12:14 PM||||id like to change a few things on my stock 2.8 to give it more ball's!,now anythign i can get off of other gm motors that will boost the hp rateings? anything from a salvage yrad i dont want to do a rebuilt or anything like that ....<P>please help thanks||||reg||1
