Z||000008||MinnGreenGT||10-01-2001||05:05 PM||||Step 1.  Remove 2.8<P>Step 2.  Insert any other motor (go 3.4 if you want it to look stock).<P>Step 2b. (optional) Add nitrous oxide system, install 100-shot nozzle.  Press Button!  (do not repeat too often).<P>Step 3.  Bring water to boil... Add rice. Allow to simmer for 5 minutes.<P>Step 4.  Eat!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
