Z||000014||88formula||10-01-2001||10:27 PM||||Remove the exhaust manifolds and port out the restrictions in them. <P>Remove the heads and put SI stainless steel valves in them with a performance valve job. Clean up the intkae and exhaust ports a little too.<P>A slightly bigger camshaft would help too. <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000015||SwissFormula||10-02-2001||02:49 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by artherd:<BR><B>Pull one out of a GTO (and I don't mean a Pontiac GTO!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I will leave it as an excercise to the reader to determine which automobiles in the US contained both the letters "GTO" in their name, and a 2.8litre engine under their skin.<P>(and wether said engine would indeed 'cook some rice'  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>-- zipp --<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>2.8l GTO?<P>Yepp!<BR>There was a mid 80's <B>Ferrari GTO</B>,<BR>-2.8l V8<BR>-Turbocharged<BR>-400HP stock!<P>it was (for a short time) the fastest car of the world, exclusive, expensive & rare. unfortunatly, imho, it looks like a hopped-up 308...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>diz engine i a fiero?<BR>GEEEZZZ, burn that rice!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>------------------<BR>88 Formula, T-Top<BR>1 of 20 Fieros in Switzerland||||reg||6
Z||000016||MikeSchaefer||10-02-2001||03:11 PM||||haha<BR>I don't mean to poke fun at people, but it seems that most of you are trying to fight rice with rice.  Face it, unless you put serious money into the 2.8, it just isn't that fast.  Adding a K&N won't really speed you up a lot, the tornado thing has been tested to be non-functional, and removing the cat won't speed you up much either.  This doesn't mean that I haven't done any of these things (have K&N + no cat), but it is by no means a rice killing machine, I'm about 50/50 when it comes to short street races.<BR>Just my 2 cents,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000017||GTMike||10-02-2001||08:01 PM||||my fiero has never lost to  rice.    well lets define rice.  hondas with tons of stickers and graphics and body mods. <P>and the only performance mods are fat cans and and intake.   <P>the v-tech is the only one that i can say cam close but he did not beet me. <P>now i have been whiped by a 3000gt. but i was raceing a civic and he decided to join in so i wasn't completely embarassed. <P>alli have is NO cat.  and a cold air intake that is a str8 shot form the outside vent to the t-body.  with a cone filter with the flither part in the nose and on the sides.<P>||||reg||1
